# Multi-up DYMO labels: several labels side by side in each row. DYMO's PPD
# describes the whole row as one page and gives no gap between the labels,
# so the row is split evenly and each label keeps the page's edge margins;
# check the real gap with a Grid test print.

Id: 30333
Family: dymo-lw
Name: 30333 1/2 × 1 in, 2 per row
Kind: diecut
WidthMm: 25.4
LengthMm: 25.4
LabelsAcross: 2
MarginLeftMm: 2.37
MarginRightMm: 1.52
MarginTopMm: 1.02
MarginBottomMm: 1.44
CornerMm: 1
Source: lw450.ppd 30333 (2 up): 72 x 72 pt, imageable 4.08 4.32 69.12 65.28

Id: 30253
Family: dymo-lw
Name: 30253 Address 28 × 89 mm, 2 per row
Kind: diecut
WidthMm: 58.67
LengthMm: 88.9
LabelsAcross: 2
MarginLeftMm: 5.76
MarginRightMm: 1.52
MarginTopMm: 1.02
MarginBottomMm: 1.44
CornerMm: 3
Source: lw450.ppd 30253 (2 up): 166.32 x 252 pt, imageable 4.08 4.32 163.44 235.68

Id: 30277
Family: dymo-lw
Name: 30277 File Folder 14 × 87 mm, 2 per row
