# From brother_ql's labels.py (ALL_LABELS): tape size in mm, printable dots
# across (and along, for die-cut labels), right offset and feed margin in
# dots. The editor's strip is the printable area, so these records have no
# margins. 102 mm and wider rolls only fit the QL-1050/1100 series.

